# --- 11-12 (w10): the spoiled vats room - optional, no quest step (plan 10 row: ACID, safe=suit). A metal annex behind
# the hall (its door on the far side from the yard): the night shift's brine vats went bad and the floor between them
# is a pool of green pickling acid; the foreman's spare locker sank in it. Work suits in the box by the door, a sign
# beside it. 5 x 4 cells, its pad levelled to the yard's 3 m; the dry strip inside the door is the way out.
brush flatten from -10 10 to -3.5 10 r=6 s=20 frames=300 h=3
brush smooth from -10 10 to -3.5 10 r=8 s=6 frames=20
brush flatten from -10 10 to -3.5 10 r=4.5 s=20 frames=200 h=3
