prop hcvatsuits beh.use=Put on a gutter's work suit
prop hcvatsuits on.use=suit||180\nmessage||A gutter's oilskin suit, rubber boots and gloves - three minutes before the brine gets through.
place Note_Sign hcvatwarn at -4.2 14.6 ground sit yaw=0
note hcvatwarn VATS ROOM - KEEP OUT | The brine vats burst. The floor burns skin and boots. Suits in the box by the door.\n- E. Hollins

